 },
 "changes": [
  "frame_pacing (Forge 1.0.41): the one FPS limiter call is queued for the display update (RenderSystem.flipFrame replays the render queue just before the buffer swap) instead of made from our mixin handler, so no method of this mod is on the stack while the limiter waits and GLFW dispatches input",
  "radium_experimental_tickets_spawning (Forge 1.0.40): ships false; the switch code is unchanged",
  "valkyrien_packets_server_thread (Forge 1.0.40): not ported, Valkyrien Skies has no Minecraft 1.21.1 build"
 ],
